Dear Partner One Software Inc Hiring Team,

Leading enterprise performance engineering across distributed cloud environments is where I've built my career — and the Performance Engineer Lead role at Partner One Software aligns directly with what I do best.

With 14 years of LoadRunner/VuGen specialization and hands-on JMeter experience, I've delivered measurable results at scale: a 40% system throughput increase and 35% reduction in defect resolution time at the USDA, and telecom-grade systems scaled to 12,000+ transactions per minute at CenturyLink. At the USDA, I led AWS/Kubernetes migration performance testing and integrated full-stack observability across AppDynamics, Splunk, Prometheus, and Grafana — directly transferable to your Azure/AKS environment. I've designed and executed load, stress, and scalability testing strategies while identifying bottlenecks across APIs, databases, and infrastructure within CI/CD pipelines.

I'm available immediately, work effectively remote, and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can lead and mentor your offshore performance engineering team.

Hans Richardson
